From 248826e1444dc7df5df30ade1d8689244ea46392 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 16:48:40 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] logging(v2): identify native treasury policy rejections with
 raw block IDs

Structure the two existing Info messages while preserving reward arithmetic,
output matching, rejection reasons and policy returns. Extend the existing
missing-output negative policy case to capture actual JSON, flush the async
logger and restore its format before checking the unchanged policy result.
The insufficient-total-payout branch is not newly forced. Native validation is
pending; no consensus or treasury payout behavior changes.

Tier: Lotus V2 ONLY. Place after f5209739e1 (native treasury contender voting,
50/25/25 reward split and default slate; Original-Patch:v2/022). Do not place
this owner or its test in the shared eCash tier.

Scripted diff (ast-grep-py0.51.0; two reviewed production sites):
/private/tmp/lane-n4-build/logging-compose/ast-venv/bin/python contrib/logging/conversion/convert.py --root . --rules contrib/logging/conversion/rules/v2-treasury-policy-diagnostics.json --report /Users/shammah/repos/lotus-v2-repair-work/logging-cleanup/treasury394-conversion.json --apply
git clang-format --force --binary /opt/homebrew/bin/clang-format --style '{BasedOnStyle: InheritParentConfig, BreakStringLiterals: false}' HEAD -- src/avalanche/treasury.cpp src/avalanche/test/treasury_tests.cpp
